:"REDACTED","action":"refused","task":"Show Your Doom Index Task Grew Post Fiat Value","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Task is stopped; wait for a new routed task if more work is needed.","routing":"request req_net_87cd22b4db36689903e73b311ff5f7ac","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"Value Accountability","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T23:11:25.020Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T02:57:26.164Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_f6157f86aa8868c9b088b5253cfc89b3","projectId":"board_value_accountability","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_f6157f86aa8868c9b088b5253cfc89b3","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"liquiditygooner","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"refused","task":"Prove Three Paid Tasks Grew Post Fiat Market Cap","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Task is stopped; wait for a new routed task if more work is needed.","routing":"request req_net_17df3e55ed06e5d3c695ef87ca971d4e","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"Value Accountability","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T23:15:42.687Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T02:57:25.477Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_185edd7b4e90c4910415a65415f7d07d","projectId":"board_value_accountability","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_185edd7b4e90c4910415a65415f7d07d","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"diamondhandhoncho","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"refused","task":"Prove Your Paid Orchard Audit Grew Post Fiat Market Cap","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Task is stopped; wait for a new routed task if more work is needed.","routing":"request req_net_97a5a49e9faceddd87ceb9f6f5f8774b","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"Value Accountability","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T23:18:01.284Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T02:57:25.091Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_cb3df06ec965e6bdb7ee56a0d9cc2ac2","projectId":"board_value_accountability","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_cb3df06ec965e6bdb7ee56a0d9cc2ac2","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"local_maxi","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"refused","task":"Prove Your Paid Critique Gist Grew Post Fiat Value","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Task is stopped; wait for a new routed task if more work is needed.","routing":"request req_net_988fe51b4984e8414c8d7c140a44f813","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"Value Accountability","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T23:19:47.900Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T02:57:24.686Z"}],"comments":[],"secretaryMemo":{"id":"hiveboardmemo_7303956c-cb62-429c-b44f-f03f68c38227","projectId":"board_value_accountability","status":"current","memoMarkdown":"# Project Status: Value Accountability\n\n## What This Project Is\n- Value Accountability is a network-validation board that checks accounts previously paid for commentary, audit, or review write-ups that Task Node no longer funds. Each flagged account is asked for a Discord handle, one openable link showing a real Post Fiat contribution, and a short explanation; refusal or a missed deadline is supposed to remove access.\n- The board has 2 active tasks and 40 terminal tasks in the supplied state, with 20 terminal tasks omitted. One active task is `verification_response_submitted` (`task_c537cd9ac6af8ba350f4f07926fa6a91`); the other is `verification_requested` (`task_86483339a23d191b83e14a6226c81c2d`). A separate review decision is described as pending publication, but its details are not in the packet.\n- There is a material standards conflict: the board objective says accounts must show market-cap accretion or be blacklisted, while the live task language accepts any checkable contribution and explicitly says past paid tasks do not need to be defended. A reviewer needs a ruling on which standard controls.\n\n## Why This Advances PFT Value\n- It protects PFT from further leakage into task shapes the network has deprecated and creates an evidence trail for future reward routing.\n- The value is now mostly in adjudication: unresolved cases either leave low-value accounts with access or leave real contributors waiting, both of which weaken trust in PFT rewards.\n- Rewarded-task evidence is truncated, so the visible 1 PFT actual rewards against 3.2 PFT offers prove payment, not contribution quality.\n\n## Current Point People\n- goodalexander: proposer of the board and apparent sponsor; no project-leader context was supplied, so the formal board manager is not named.\n- @CFO working-capital and operating metrics trackers (`acct_REDACTED`): holds the only `verification_requested` task, `task_86483339a23d191b83e14a6226c81c2d`; must supply Discord handle, openable link, and explanation. The taskgen summary names `@lc66`, so identity needs confirmation.\n- acct_REDACTED: submitted a response on `task_c537cd9ac6af8ba350f4f07926fa6a91`; needs reviewer adjudication. The taskgen summary names `@diamondhandhoncho`, so identity needs confirmation.\n\n## Operators Needed\n- Reviewer/adjudicator: to decide the submitted response and the outstanding verification against the live acceptance criteria.\n- Identity reconciliation operator: to reconcile taskgen handles (`@diamondhandhoncho`, `@lc66`) with contributor records before any enforcement.\n- Board operations publisher: to publish the separate pending review decision and ensure terminal refusal outcomes are recorded consistently.\n\n## Next Tactics\n- Adjudicate `task_c537cd9ac6af8ba350f4f07926fa6a91` first: verify the submitted Discord handle, open the link, confirm the explanation, and record pass/fail. Do not leave it in `verification_response_submitted`.\n- Resolve `task_86483339a23d191b83e14a6226c81c2d` next: confirm whether the contributor is the `@lc66` named in the taskgen summary, check for any late submission, and apply the board’s stated deadline consequence if none is valid.\n- Publish the pending review decision and reconcile the 40 terminal tasks, especially refused cases, before generating more value-accountability work. Resolve the objective-vs-task-language conflict at the same time.\n\n## Overall Strategy\n- Move the board from generation to enforcement. The high-value path is to close the two live cases, fix identity mismatches, publish the pending decision, and use verified contribution evidence to separate real contributors from accounts that only consumed rewards. That protects PFT by stopping low-value payouts and preserving access for contributors who can prove value.\n\n## Recommendation For Task Management Agent\n- Treat this as an adjudication queue, not a task-generation queue. Route `task_c537cd9ac6af8ba350f4f07926fa6a91` to a reviewer, resolve `task_86483339a23d191b83e14a6226c81c2d` and its identity mismatch, publish the pending review decision, and reconcile terminal refusals. Hold new value-accountability task generation until the live cases and the acceptance-standard conflict are resolved.","sourcePacketDigest":"7e75b5785e102ccd5aaabd504e735c3e3772b73664b6ed2fa368054803d56211","sourceCounts":{"activeTaskCount":2,"boardCommentCount":0,"terminalTaskCount":40,"omittedActiveTaskCount":0,"eligibleContributorCount":52,"omittedTerminalTaskCount":20,"pendingGenerationJobCount":0,"projectLeaderContextCount":0},"provider":"vercel","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017","promptVersion":"glm_board_secretary_status_memo_v1","promptDigest":"2a91391300f9d46e816eaddca5d1438785746de769c08d0e44b5d3ccab7911cf","usage":{"costUsd":0.014517,"latencyMs":47804,"inputTokens":26398,"totalTokens":31896,"outputTokens":5498,"reasoningTokens":4514},"error":"","generatedAt":"2026-11-12T12:46:43.886Z","createdAt":"2026-11-12T12:46:44.392Z"},"tasksInFlight":2,"terminalTaskCount":60,"nextTask":{"taskId":"task_86483339a23d191b83e14a6226c81c2d","title":"Show One Real Post Fiat Contribution With a Checkable Link","state":"verification_requested","viewerScoped":false,"viewerRelation":"","viewerActive":false,"assignee":"rREDACTED","assigneeAccountId":"acct_REDACTED","assigneeHasPublicProfile":true,"assigneeHandle":"lc66","assigneeDisplayName":"Finance Operations and Network Governance Specialist","pft":3.2,"nextAction":"Answer the reviewer follow-up with the missing verification detail.","updatedAt":"2026-09-28T12:37:43.974Z"}}},"archivedProjects":{"pfterminal_development":{"id":"pfterminal_development","name":"PF Terminal Development","type":"Protocol Development","typeKey":"protocol_development","summary":"Resolve PfTerminal bug reports and generate engineering tasks for idle developers.","status":"archived","priority":1,"pft":0,"taskCount":0,"tasksInFlight":0,"terminalTaskCount":0,"contributorCount":0,"pendingGenerationCount":0,"archivedAt":"2026-08-05T23:44:23.645611+00:00","archivedReason":"","operatorArchiveLock":true,"lastActivityAt":""},"post_fiat_proof_of_reserves_communications":{"id":"post_fiat_proof_of_reserves_communications","name":"Post Fiat Launch Communications","type":"Protocol Marketing","typeKey":"protocol_marketing","summary":"Unblock external amplification and contributor motivation with approved launch timing, ramp, and contribution-to-value messaging.","status":"archived","priority":2,"pft":0,"taskCount":0,"tasksInFlight":0,"terminalTaskCount":0,"contributorCount":0,"pendingGenerationCount":0,"archivedAt":"2026-08-05T23:44:23.645611+00:00","archivedReason":"","operatorArchiveLock":true,"lastActivityAt":""},"pfterminal_integration":{"id":"pfterminal_integration","name":"PfTerminal Integration","type":"Protocol Development","typeKey":"protocol_development","summary":"Deliver PfTerminal Telegram channel support through public PRs, demo evidence, and upstream merge coordination.","status":"archived","priority":3,"pft":0,"taskCount":0,"tasksInFlight":0,"terminalTaskCount":0,"contributorCount":0,"pendingGenerationCount":0,"archivedAt":"2026-08-05T23:44:23.645611+00:00","archivedReason":"","operatorArchiveLock":true,"lastActivityAt":""},"post_fiat_launch_communications":{"id":"post_fiat_launch_communications","name":"Post Fiat Launch Communications","type":"Protoco