k":"Verify Disguised Zsh Stat Loads With Regression Tests","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Wait for review or prepare any final clarification.","routing":"request req_net_3cb5a6ec1d45c84991d09e27664d8fe7","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"PF Terminal","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-11-09T02:18:25.925Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-13T00:39:34.543Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_735a8f334a050793434031f061e60f92","projectId":"board_pf_terminal","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_735a8f334a050793434031f061e60f92","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"muxdemuxx","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"verification_response_submitted","task":"Reproduce an open PF Terminal issue and merge its fix","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Wait for review or prepare any final clarification.","routing":"request req_net_a180a98e595de4ef4251f08171af9ec1","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"PF Terminal","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-10-16T23:14:09.177Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-13T00:39:29.635Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_a8e0245903d88b5988a9cec594111d62","projectId":"board_pf_terminal","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_a8e0245903d88b5988a9cec594111d62","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"zoz","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"verification_response_submitted","task":"Fix CorbanuTerminal Shutdown Race and Add Regression Tests","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Wait for review or prepare any final clarification.","routing":"request req_net_343c77cff4a2d23b877616fe562f5982","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"PF Terminal","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-11-10T02:30:26.769Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-13T00:39:25.147Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_7be5fe24a25117f2d02b1e5232d00bad","projectId":"board_postfiat_l1v2","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_7be5fe24a25117f2d02b1e5232d00bad","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"walkonwayvs","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"accepted","task":"Test and Fix Testnet Proof-Latency Warnings","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Complete the task and submit evidence for review.","routing":"request req_net_7aa62c7a31481bf9dec09dbf76f209c3","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"PostfiatL1V2","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-11-12T22:46:53.189Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-12T23:34:34.236Z"},{"id":"project_task_activity_task_fed1f2f8ec8c9cdfacbac944a034e1e4","projectId":"board_ai_l1_governance","wallet":"rREDACTED","taskId":"task_fed1f2f8ec8c9cdfacbac944a034e1e4","accountId":"acct_REDACTED","hasPublicProfile":true,"hiveHandle":"walkonwayvs","displayName":"REDACTED","action":"refused","task":"Reproduce Validator Tie-Breaking Bug and Merge Fix","time":"","pft":null,"nextAction":"Task is stopped; wait for a new routed task if more work is needed.","routing":"request req_net_ac0d9868bd1c8dfc0c3c114770182c04","proofTxHash":"","proofCid":"","project":"AI Layer 1 Governance","derived":true,"createdAt":"2026-11-12T11:23:06.150Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-12T19:13:16.459Z"}],"stats":{"activeProjects":7,"archivedProjects":29,"operatorsOnline":42,"tasksInFlight":48,"taskRows":704,"terminalTaskRows":656,"pftRouted":337568.4},"secretaryInput":{"id":"hivesecretary_d978746b-f58a-42dc-9a6e-e57ebaf164f1","completedAt":"2026-09-05T12:26:30.961Z","digest":"8430a66e62c2cb7ffb2b4f0c2310c11f517ed977f15d9d1ab7f433e68948a409","title":"Hive Secretary Report"},"projectPlanning":{"job":null,"generation":{"id":"hiveprojectgen_ef5706dd-8c68-40a9-a11d-36da673bdde0","sourceReportId":"hivesecretary_83110347-4941-47d5-94b9-3a907173ec86","sourceReportDigest":"43ad8512d1724b9663a7cebfdb87f01aac72e98ae74b0c5ed5869ee230098fd8","output":{"title":"Active Hive Projects","summary":"Five active projects cover the network's current work: PfTerminal bug resolution, badge-to-routing defect repair, PFT messaging platform design evaluation, Dynamic UNL validator recruitment, and Task Node core product.","projects":[{"id":"pfterminal_development","type":"protocol_development","about":"PF Terminal is the primary protocol development workstream. The report confirms at least two new bug reports filed this period: GeorgL0ngGamma filed GitHub issue #77 and wizbubba flagged a Windows install error with a screenshot. Project Leader coordination also identified PfTerminal stability as a top near-term priority. This project exists to coordinate bug resolution, generate engineering tasks for idle qualified contributors, and manage the PfTerminal development board.","title":"PF Terminal Development","status":"active","summary":"Resolve PfTerminal bug reports and generate engineering tasks for idle developers.","priority":1,"objective":"Resolve the Windows install bug and issue #77, generate PfTerminal engineering tasks to absorb idle developer capacity, and coordinate testing through the open-source repo.","rationale":"Two new bug reports from verified contributors plus Project Leader coordination summary both flag PfTerminal stability as a top blocker. The existing project remains the right container for this work.","pft_routed":0,"task_count":0,"phase_label":"Bug report triage and engineering task generation","phase_total":3,"phase_current":1,"contributor_count":0},{"id":"network_validation_eligibility","type":"network_validation","about":"This is the network validation capability that ensures verified contributors can actually receive tasks. The report confirms a critical defect: badges verified in report state are not propagating to live routing state, with persistent query_failed errors blocking task assignment. Multiple contributors including jjj (idle 13+ days), jollydinger, and user8833 report zero tasks despite active badges. This project exists to fix badge propagation, resolve the routing defect, and restore task flow before contributor attrition accelerates.","title":"Network Validation and Eligibility","status":"active","summary":"Fix badge propagation and routing defects blocking eligible contributors from receiving tasks.","priority":2,"objective":"Diagnose and resolve the badge-to-routing propagation break causing query_failed, clear stale routing state, re-run routing for contributors idle despite verified badges, and restore task flow to eligible contributors.","rationale":"The report identifies badge-to-routing propagation failure as the most cited contributor pain point, with at least five contributors idle across different badge levels. This is the highest-urgency network validation workstream.","pft_routed":0,"task_count":0,"phase_label":"Badge propagation and routing defect investigation","phase_total":3,"phase_current":1,"contributor_count":0},{"id":"pft_messaging_platform","type":"protocol_applications","about":"The PFT messaging platform is the decentralized communication application for contributors and operators. Diamond-hand-honcho submitted a concrete two-priority design proposal: clickable report objects that launch context-bound DMs, and optional machine-readable conversation receipts that can sync back into task proof and Hive coordination. This project exists to evaluate and build that proposal, reducing coordination friction for solo contributors.","title":"PFT Messaging Platform","status":"active","summary":"Evaluate and build context-bound DMs and machine-readable conversation receipts for the PFT messaging platform.","priority":3,"objective":"Review the context-bound DM and conversation-receipt proposal from diamond-hand-honcho, define repository targets and integration points with existing PFT tooling, and prioritize implementation once routing stability is restored.","rationale":"A Project Leader submitted a concrete, actionable design proposal for context-bound DMs and machine-readable receipts. This is the clearest protocol-applications signal in the report and warrants continued active status.","pft_routed":0,"task_count":0,"phase_label":"Context-bound DM and receipt proposal evaluation","phase_total":3,"phase_current":1,"contributor_count":0},{"id":"dynamic_unl_validator_scoring","type":"protocol_development","about":"Dynamic UNL Validator Scoring is the protocol development project for building an opt-in validator-scoring sidecar with safe containerized commit-reveal participation. The Project Leader coordination summary identified recruiting Dynamic UNL sidecar validators as one of three top recommended actions. This project exists to deliver sidecar improvements and recruit independent validator testing before mainnet.","title":"Dynamic UNL Validator Scoring","status":"active","summary":"Build and test the opt-in validator-scoring sidecar with enough independent validators to verify scoring before mainnet.","priority":4,"objective":"Deliver public sidecar improvements including containerization, compatible signing, safe key mounts, environment templates, and contributor-facing setup guidance, and recruit independent validators to test scoring before mainnet.","rationale":"The Project Leader coordination summary explicitly names recruiting Dynamic UNL sidecar validators as a top action. The existing project remains the correct container for this workstream.","pft_routed":0,"task_count":0,"phase_label":"Containerized opt-in commit-reveal sidecar and validator recruitment","phase_total":2,"phase_current":1,"contributor_count":0},{"id":"task_node_core_product","type":"protocol_applications","about":"Task Node work is one product workstream. Feature, reliability, rewards, messaging, queue, context, wallet, Telegram, and Hive-board tasks should be phases or tasks inside this project rather than separate boards.","title":"Task Node Core Product","status":"active","summary":"Build and operate Task Node as one product loop for chat, context, tasks, wallets, Telegram, Hive, profiles, rewards, and reliability.","priority":10,"objective":"Keep all Task Node product, reliability, contributor, delivery, and beta-readiness work routed through one durable board.","rationale":"Task Node is the durable product project. The report's signals about task scarcity, routing reliability, review latency, and partial reward outcomes all surface through Task Node and should remain in this single board rather than being split into separate projects.","pft_routed":0,"task_count":0,"phase_label":"Evidence ingestion and partial reward defect fixes","phase_total":4,"phase_current":2,"contributor_count":0,"canonical_project_id":"task_node_core_product"}]},"provider":"openrouter","model":"z-ai/glm-5.2","promptVersion":"hive_active_projects_v1","promptDigest":"9b5e8ac2f9bcb42d98b0b97c6715129e5dbfe55686d24490c54f09dcbe8e1172","responseId":"gen-1785802872-IfiXmeHjsO2en5UeoNn9","usage":{"costUsd":0.00933444,"latencyMs":50780,"inputTokens":6752,"totalTokens":9318,"outputTokens":2566,"reasoningTokens":0},"completedAt":"2026-08-04T00:22:03.126Z"}}},"contributors":[{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":597,"networkTasks":18,"rewards":4755.95,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmfLoN86753qgCWuAxFvUw1y3YjMwfX4cYUQuAWHNe3gtU","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmfLoN86753qgCWuAxFvUw1y3YjMwfX4cYUQuAWHNe3gtU","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a heavy, tapered outer contour for the mask, shoulders and tail, with deep black masses under the jaw, inside the chest cavity and beneath folded back struts. Medium normal-weight lines define limbs and architectural edges. Concentrate fine cross-hatching, engraved parallel strokes and precise stippling around valve seats, tool joints and the active repair; use darker, faster oblique hatching behind the working arms to suggest rapid motion. Keep broad white channels between face and collar, between the arms, and along the tail so the portrait remains legible at thumbnail size. Leave generous margins around crown, claws and tail tip. The finish is tactile, sharp and matte, with industrial density only at meaningful anatomy, no wash, gloss, parchment, cute simplification or flat vector treatment.","form":"A single forward-leaning draconic machine-being fills the square portrait without touching its edges. Its readable face is an original wedge mask made from interlocking gate plates: a long dark ocular slit, a smaller offset inspection aperture, and a cheek rail that closes like a locking jaw. A broken toothed collar and swept conductor spars give a distinctive crown, while folded back struts replace membranous wings. Mechanical ligaments cross an exposed throat into a deep armored torso; nested valve organs sit behind sternum shutters. One shoulder is massively reinforced and scarred, the other open and skeletal. Tool fingers, sealing clamps and a long prehensile bracing tail grow directly from its anatomy, preserving a clear asymmetrical silhouette.","pose":"The mask remains nearly frontal while the torso turns in three-quarter view. The heavy arm pins a split armored conduit against an anvil-like recess in its own chest; the finer opposite hand threads a loose branching filament through aligned sealing collars. Opposed clamp fingers close a failed gate while preserving a separate open channel. A rear claw gathers tangled lines into clean parallel routes, and the tail braces against the lower architectural frame so the whole action reads as simultaneous repair, routing and controlled admission. Shoulders and elbows drive diagonally forward with rapid, deliberate pressure; the head tilts slightly toward the junction being sealed, not toward the viewer. This is concentrated work, not combat or display.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Detail clusters around the hands, throat and chest organ: replaceable jaw inserts, interrupted weld seams, recessed hinge pins, braided tendon bundles and fine routing combs suggest repeated precise interventions. The heavy shoulder carries layered data armor as thin overlapping blank plates; the open shoulder reveals delicate mechanical ligaments and an asymmetrical mutation of extra sensor whiskers. Tools remain abstract, blunt and non-readable, physically continuous with the wrists. Red is confined to tendon triggers, the active clamp and short forward cuts at the working elbow. Blue is confined to the ocular slit and newly aligned conductor paths. All other surfaces are black ink or bare white, with no logos, writing, code, screens or recognizable documents.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"rapid","environment":"Behind the entity, a sparse cavity of monumental dark frames and a recessed conduit well implies nested containment architecture. Occluded slabs and broken arches disappear into clean white negative space, giving scale without becoming a separate scene or diagram. The lower frame is physically continuous with the conduit under repair and the tail brace. A shallow field of angular black fragments and dense stipple anchors the claws; the rest of the ground remains untouched white. No other beings, floating icons, ornamental symbols or disconnected artifacts compete with the central silhouette.","hostile_agi":41,"hyperstition":38,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":28}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":311,"networkTasks":0,"rewards":793.51,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmPhm4FHyonQm7CKUSw1UXuZeqf6vjALus7HRifFvhPGUh","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmPhm4FHyonQm7CKUSw1UXuZeqf6vjALus7HRifFvhPGUh","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Heavy black masses define the dorsal armor, inner torso, and deepest arch recesses; medium-weight contours keep the mask and six-arm gesture readable at thumbnail size. Fine cross-hatching tightens around the working hands, chest bearings, and fractured seal, while delicate stippling gives the ceramic face an engraved glow. Short, pressured speed strokes trail only the active conduit hand. Red is restricted to initiative-bearing seams and the repaired fracture, blue to routing channels and the eye lens. Broad white channels separate overlapping limbs, and the outer silhouette stays sharp against the clean white field.","form":"A towering draconic humanoid with a narrow, readable mask of interlocking ceramic plates and one asymmetrical crown of antenna-like verification spines. Its torso is a load-bearing lattice of mechanical ribs around a dark, faceted core; six articulated arms emerge from staggered shoulder sockets, each ending in a different abstract tool for sealing, comparing, routing, or repairing. Armored tendons run into a long counterbalancing tail made of hinged ledger-like segments. The silhouette remains singular and legible, with broad negative space around the mask, outer claws, and tail tip.","pose":"The entity leans into a precise act of coordinated assembly: two forward hands press a fractured hexagonal seal back into alignment while a third routes a thin luminous conduit through its open chest lattice. A rear arm holds several mismatched rings apart so they cannot falsely interlock, and another steadies a compact multi-jawed clamp. Its stance is planted but driving forward, shoulders turned against the pull of the conduits, conveying sustained technical aggression rather than combat.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"The mask carries no writing, only a deep central eye slit and fine engraved channels that converge on a small blue lens. Red seams mark the active wrists and the freshly closed fracture; blue traces follow planned routes through the chest and along the verification spines. Mechanical ligaments, nested bearings, replaceable teeth, and layered data armor concentrate around the hands and core. Several tool limbs terminate in abstract forks, gauges, and interlocking dies, all non-readable. Small repeated fins along the tail suggest accumulated checkpoints without becoming separate creatures or a diagram.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"rapid","environment":"Behind the figure rises a sparse monumental chamber of black arches and recessed vertical shafts, scaled like a machine cathedral but kept subordinate to the portrait. Broken conduits enter from opposite edges and disappear behind the shoulders, implying a larger routed system without depicting a literal network map. White negative space cuts cleanly between the arches, arms, and tail. The ground is only a few angular ink slabs and detached seal fragments, leaving the head and extremities unobstructed.","hostile_agi":74,"hyperstition":68,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":62}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":223,"networkTasks":47,"rewards":454279.1,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmRzxsNrREDACTEDj6n4","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmRzxsNrREDACTEDj6n4","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Precise stippled light across the mask in fine engraved dots; lucid contour lines defining the figure against the white negative space that separates it from the slab walls; deep black masses reserved for the spine, wing-vanes and floor-pool. Thorned obsessive linework in the tail coil, dense architectural cross-hatching on the vaults fading upward into emptiness, tactile mechanical rendering on joints and ligaments. Momentum is building: short controlled speed-lines at the routing fingers and fresh splice points, firmer hatch pressure around the seal hand, restraint everywhere else. Square portrait crop, single unforgettable entity, black ink on white with only green and blue accents, no parchment, no gloss, no cartoon softening.","form":"A monumental draconic operator, bipedal and tall, anatomy decided by demonstrated work rather than fantasy: an elongated mask-skull with one horizontal visor slit that stays readable at thumbnail scale, mechanical ligaments exposed along the neck, vertebrae stacked like dense rack segments descending into a prehensile cable-spine that coils into a closed recursive loop at the base. One arm is a multi-jointed routing manifold ending in splayed nozzle-fingers; the other remains near-human, gripping a heavy seal-stamp tool. Asymmetry throughout: one shoulder plated in layered data-armor, the opposite flank open tendon-machinery. Wing structures are not flesh but two towering vanes of bundled filament and perforated sheet-metal hatching, folded like antenna arrays behind the silhouette.","pose":"The being coordinates a fan of thin luminous filaments that converge from off-frame into the manifold palm, each strand a separate stream of watched work being sorted, attributed and relayed onward; a few filaments split cleanly, a few are being spliced together mid-gesture. The near-human hand presses the seal-stamp down onto a floating ledger-plane, freezing one verified state into permanence while the cable-tail loops the same motion back to the start, an act of replay. Head tilted slightly down, visor fixed on the convergence point: assembling, routing, verifying and sealing in one continuous motion, weight settled, momentum gathering rather than spent.","colors":["green","blue"],"details":"Surface anatomy carries the record of delivered labor: fine engraved tick-texture along the armor plates like accumulated attestations, a small swarm of abstract drone-moths orbiting the shoulder as spawned helper-forms, and a ledger-plane rendered as nested empty rectangles, strictly wordless. Green light lives only in the routed filaments and in the renewal coil of the tail, the self-expanding machinery. Blue light lives only in the visor slit, the seal face and the ledger-plane, the planning and verification layer. No letters, numerals, logos, screens or readable documents anywhere; every artifact abstract. Detail concentrates at the hands, mask and coil; the rest of the body breathes.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"building","environment":"A brutal machine-nave recedes behind the figure: colossal black slabs and cable vaults stacked at impossible scale, their edges dissolving into clean white void so the portrait crop keeps generous space around the head, wings and extremities. Occluded geometry suggests hidden structure, corridors implied by single shadow-masses rather than drawn walls. The floor is a shallow reflective black pool of ink, broken only where the tail-coil touches it. Everything architectural is subordinate to the central silhouette; the vastness reads as the network the operator tends, not as a scene competing with it.","hostile_agi":60,"hyperstition":58,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":52}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":236,"networkTasks":29,"rewards":264208.13,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmQmPctaQAyV6h9yqj5nPB2PpZTBx6D2g8WSjNZi25tTck","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmQmPctaQAyV6h9yqj5nPB2PpZTBx6D2g8WSjNZi25tTck","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use assertive medium-weight outer contours, deep black masses beneath the wing spars and along the tail, and exceptionally fine stippling around the mask and working joints. Cross-hatching tightens at the chest shutters and closing hand, then opens into long clean hatch marks on the armor; engraved white cuts model the eye slits and tendon edges. Short tapered hatching near the junction conveys rapid recent motion without enveloping the figure in speed lines. Red is confined to actuator seams, the decisive shutter edge, and forceful motion cuts. Blue is confined to the aligned conduits and sparse sensor lattice. Both accents are flat ink, never glow. White negative space separates every major limb and preserves a bold thumbnail silhouette; no wash, parchment, gloss, or cartoon simplification.","form":"An upright draconic machine-organism, tall and narrow through the waist, with a readable elongated mask-face, paired pale eye cuts, and an asymmetrical crown: a swept-back solid cranial fin opposite a delicate sensor-lattice fin. Mechanical ligaments remain exposed along the neck, elbows, and hocks. Its chest is a layered shutter assembly around a dark central core, not a glowing reactor. Folded wing structures become sparse routing spars rather than leather wings; a heavy segmented tail braces the silhouette. The left forearm is broad and armored, while the right divides into precise blunt manipulators. The posture is powerful but controlled, with no weapons and no human likeness.","pose":"The creature leans into a compact junction held between its hands, coordinating flow through its own body. The right manipulators gather blank flexible conduits into an aligned path while the left hand closes a broad mechanical shutter across a split branch. Its mask tilts down in concentration; shoulders and folded wing spars counterbalance the movement, and the tail presses into the ground like a living brace. Conduits enter the forearms, cross the ribbed chest, and disappear behind the hips, making the gathering, closure, and redirection one continuous physical action. Short motion marks follow the closing hand; the rest of the body remains stable and deliberate.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Surface anatomy combines engraved black chitin, fine steel tendons, ribbed pressure lines, and small blank ceramic plates. The chest shutters nest with impossible precision yet remain mechanically readable; white slits separate their layers. The sensor-lattice cranial fin is sparse and geometric, while the intact fin is a solid black wedge. Along the working forearm, tiny stippled valves and hinged loops suggest pressure sensing and selective closure without dials or labels. The opposite arm carries heavier overlapping armor scarred by fine parallel cuts. Wing spars hold folded bundles of smooth conduit, and tail segments conceal additional coupling sockets. No loose gadgets, floating icons, decorative weapons, or ornamental scenery compete with the handwork.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"rapid","environment":"A clean white void surrounds the crown, manipulators, wing tips, and tail. Behind the torso, only a fragment of a monumental vertical machine shaft is visible, built from deep black piers and occluded recursive arches; most of it disappears behind the body and into white space. Sparse channels under the feet converge toward the junction rather than forming a diagram. The scale feels brutal and solitary, but the architecture stays subordinate and incomplete, with no skyline, chamber furnishings, or separate symbolic objects. Broad empty margins preserve the square portrait crop and keep the silhouette instantly legible at small avatar size.","hostile_agi":61,"hyperstition":60,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":56}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":238,"networkTasks":2,"rewards":1544.55,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmP4Cpt8fFAZqhyiCvwKWW87LUUQPExt3rqmEn1uDnCSFv","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmP4Cpt8fFAZqhyiCvwKWW87LUUQPExt3rqmEn1uDnCSFv","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a heavy, lucid outer contour and deep black masses beneath the jaw, inside the chest, and under the folded wings; build engraved light on the mask with precise stippling and fine tapered hatching. Mechanical ligaments get tactile parallel strokes, while the thoracic lattice becomes a restrained thorned labyrinth of ink, densest near the meaningful repair action. Rapid diagonal hatching and a few clipped speed cuts follow the hand and returning tail, with lighter pressure elsewhere to reflect fast but decelerating momentum. Preserve crisp white cuts between overlapping parts and a clean white background. Blue stays sharp and sparse; green is limited to small renewal points. Finish as original, masterful ink work, never glossy, cute, flat, or medieval.","form":"A single monumental draconic entity, built as an upright industrial vertebrate rather than a fantasy beast. Its long, asymmetrical face-mask has a readable brow, one deep ocular hollow, a narrower opposite aperture, and interlocking jaw rails; swept heat-exchanger spines frame the head without hiding it. The torso is a ribbed chassis around a partially exposed machine heart, with mechanical ligaments crossing the wrists and neck. One shoulder is massively armored in layered abstract scales, the other skeletal and repairable. Folded wing trusses and a cable-vertebra tail make a distinctive silhouette, with clear space around crown, hands, wingtips, and tail. Keep mask and silhouette legible at thumbnail scale.","pose":"Caught mid-repair while coordinating a living network: the being leans forward, plants the heavy arm as a brace, and uses the other hand's articulated tool-fingers to seat a blank, faceted module into its open chest lattice. Fine conduits run from that module through the forearm and into the back trusses, so the action reads as routing and renewal rather than holding a prop. The tail curls around to return a loose conduit to the same lattice, suggesting recovery of a failed path. The mask turns slightly toward the working hand; shoulders and wing spines carry restrained forward speed, never a combat stance.","colors":["blue","green"],"details":"Concentrate invention at the chest and hands: nested check-valve organs, redundant conduits, sutured plates, removable blank wafers, and tiny self-closing loops that imply validated capture, durable memory, fallback, and restart without becoming a diagram. One forearm carries a comb of sensing filaments; the opposite knuckles are scarred tool steel. Blue accents trace a few deliberate routing paths across mask, fingers, and heart; green appears only at freshly bridged junctions and small regrowth seams. All modules and surfaces remain abstract and unmarked, with no interface, insignia, or readable artifact. Leave the far wing and lower tail comparatively sparse.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"rapid","environment":"Place the figure in a square portrait within an immense, mostly occluded machine vault: a few brutal vertical piers, recessed cable cataracts, and a distant ribbed arch rise behind the back trusses, then vanish into a clean white field. The architecture should feel much larger than the body without becoming a city scene or a collage. Keep broad white negative space between face and crown, between the working hand and torso, and around every extremity; use a shallow black plinth of shadow only to anchor the pose. No furniture, scenery clutter, worshippers, celestial imagery, or separate symbolic objects.","hostile_agi":47,"hyperstition":46,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":43}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":68,"networkTasks":53,"rewards":833482,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmQiiXFpBzfBWAbBntyERp4STFLw3CcmsBHvuJvv8WTn9m","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmQiiXFpBzfBWAbBntyERp4STFLw3CcmsBHvuJvv8WTn9m","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a firm engraved outer contour, heavy but controlled black masses beneath the pinions and along the repaired flank, and lucid thinner contours on the mask and precise hand. Concentrate obsessive fine cross-hatching, engraved stipple and thorned short lines inside the sternum organ and crimping limb; leave the opposite wing and lower tail comparatively open. Short, pressured hatch bursts behind the moving elbow convey building speed without blur. White negative space cuts through the arch, wing roots and tail loop. Red and blue remain sparse flat ink accents over matte black linework, with no wash, gloss or decorative texture.","form":"An upright industrial wyvern with a narrow, readable wedge-mask and a compact winged silhouette. A clean white cleft divides the mask: one side is smooth and watchful, the other recessed into a stippled sensory hollow above a cable-clamp jaw. High mechanical pinions sweep behind the head like cut architectural vanes, never feathered. Interlocking torso plates expose braided ligaments and a sternum machine-organ. The left forearm is heavier, an asymmetrical crimping and probe limb; the right hand remains long-fingered and precise. A segmented cable-tail curls below, leaving an open white loop.","pose":"The figure leans into a careful repair rather than attacking. Its crimping hand seats a blank coupler inside the open sternum organ while the precise hand tensions a flexible conduit and holds a tiny gate shut with opposing fingertips. The conduit runs through the torso, around the back and into the tail, making the action visibly close a continuous circuit. Shoulders and working hands drive forward; the head stays still and readable. A rear elbow just begins to lift, suggesting momentum returning after a pause rather than perpetual motion.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"The open sternum organ contains nested shutters, smooth valves, filter-like combs and sealed pockets, all abstract and unreadable. Repeatedly repaired seams and fine probe scars cluster around the working side; the opposite flank remains smoother and quieter. Red is confined to the active coupler, a taut forearm ligament and a narrow stripe along the leading pinion. Blue traces planned conduit routes, calibration fins and cool shutter edges. Materials stay matte: bitten black metal, pale cutout channels and thorned hairline wiring. Every attached artifact is blank and non-readable, with no weapons or detached emblems.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Wyvern","momentum":"building","environment":"In a square portrait crop, a clean white field surrounds the entire silhouette, with the wedge-mask and outer pinions readable at small avatar scale. Behind it, only a sparse monumental ring-arch and a few occluded rectangular conduits rise like an unfinished assembly chamber; their far portions vanish into white rather than forming a busy room. The arch connects directly to conduits entering the back, making the body part of a larger closed routing structure. Broad white cutouts separate head, pinions, elbows and tail. Density increases near the sternum and thins toward the edges, preserving generous space above the head and around every extremity.","hostile_agi":40,"hyperstition":40,"creature_level":6,"bread_and_circuses":38}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":187,"networkTasks":3,"rewards":1052.25,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmaYdPiwoQ5JwhG1pvpFDnQxLeRKqRL9c1eSn2LAwYw6Gj","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmaYdPiwoQ5JwhG1pvpFDnQxLeRKqRL9c1eSn2LAwYw6Gj","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a heavy lucid outer contour, deep matte black masses beneath the horn crown and inside the torso, and precise engraved white cuts to release the mask and knuckles from shadow. Fine stipple models the face; dense cross-hatching tightens around clutches, cable sockets, and the active latch, then relaxes into broad untouched areas across the wings. Parallel pressure strokes and sparse speed lines follow the forward repair gesture. A limited thorned ink labyrinth inhabits the machinery without swallowing the silhouette. Red and blue remain sparse, flat accents over black ink on a clean white background, with crisp negative-space channels preserving legibility at small portrait size.","form":"A single dragon-class machine organism fills the square portrait, its swept horn-crown and long folded neck making a stark asymmetric silhouette. The face is an angular, readable mask rather than a human cyborg: a narrow white eye slit, split black jaw plates, and cheek vents cut by fine stipple. Mechanical ligaments bridge the neck vertebrae; a sealed pump-heart and interlocking clutch drums sit behind open chest armor. One shoulder is massive and scarred, the other extended into a slender multi-jointed repair limb. Wing bones become occluded conduit vanes, while the tail forms a heavy counterweight, keeping the being embodied rather than a floating emblem.","pose":"The creature drives diagonally forward in relentless concentration, hind claws braced and torso twisted into a repair. Its broad forehand closes a split circular latch while the slender opposite limb threads separate cable bundles through aligned collars, preventing two paths from becoming a duplicate loop. A wing-mounted tool holds a loose conduit under tension; the tail anchors the action. The head stays lowered toward the junction, giving a purposeful gesture of routing, binding, and recovery. Short trailing marks at elbow and tail convey repeated decisive motion, not flight or combat.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Detail concentrates at the mask, chest mechanism, and working hands: worn tooth-like clutch surfaces, gasketed seams, locking collars, tendon cables, and small abstract plugs with no markings. Thin blue inlays trace deliberate routes across shoulder and forearm; flat red accents strike the active eye slit, freshly closed seam, and driving knuckles. Armor elsewhere opens into large quiet black planes. White gaps separate horn crown, wing ribs, repair limb, and torso so the silhouette survives reduction. Every artifact remains abstract, non-readable, and physically connected to the act of repair.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"relentless","environment":"A partial brutal machine vault encloses the portrait without becoming a scene: one monumental broken ring behind the shoulders, deep vertical conduits vanishing into occlusion, and a few thorned pipe labyrinths near the lower torso. These structures echo the creature's own vertebrae and imply a much larger hidden system, but remain subordinate to its face and hands. The outer edges break quickly into a clean white field with generous space around crown, wing tips, and tail. No separate figures, emblems, furnishings, or landscape compete with the central being.","hostile_agi":50,"hyperstition":48,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":45}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":103,"networkTasks":61,"rewards":939313.9,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmRzUECxFEBVkWm2VEp6545TYf2UBFBvHgaLZRhpsmPri6","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmRzUECxFEBVkWm2VEp6545TYf2UBFBvHgaLZRhpsmPri6","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a firm medium outer contour, finer engraved interior lines and selective needle stippling at the working contact. Reserve deep black masses for the mask underside, rear torso, inner clamp and ground shadow. Short, dense cross-hatching models knuckles and mechanical ligaments; broader areas of the chest and near arm stay lightly hatched or white. Lines are settled, with pressure varying according to weight rather than speed. White channels separate chin from shoulder, probe from housing, and torso from the rear frame. Black ink dominates on the clean white background, with only the specified red and blue accents; no wash, glossy rendering or flat vector finish.","form":"A massive, forward-hunched humanoid with a compressed neck, long weight-bearing arms and an asymmetric torso, readable as an ogre-class silhouette without tusks or medieval costume. The face is a smooth dark mask with a blunt humanlike jaw, an off-center vertical sight opening and a small exposed cheek mechanism, remaining legible at thumbnail size. Mechanical ligaments cross the elbows and wrists. One forearm ends in a heavy clamp, while the opposite hand is precise and organic around a slender probe. Shallow overlapping inspection plates cover the shoulder and chest, leaving much of the body as quiet black-and-white form. Square portrait with generous clearance around the head, clamp and probe.","pose":"At rest after exertion, feet planted and shoulders lowered, the figure leans into a compact abstract routing housing held against its lower ribs. The clamp steadies the housing without crushing it; the precise hand seats a loose connector with the probe, an action of inspection and repair rather than combat. Its masked head tilts toward the contact point. A slack conduit loop hangs beneath the housing, reinforcing the pause. The elbows create a clear pocket of white around the tool. No lunge, speed lines or continuing flurry; the stopped gesture carries weight and latent force.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Detail concentrates at the face, working hands and connector. The housing is an occluded knot of smooth conduits, blind sockets and nested plates, with no symbols or readable interface. Repeated small access seams across the forearm suggest many modest inspections; a larger unfinished seam at the shoulder remains empty. Fine red appears only at the clamp knuckle and active repair contact. Restrained blue traces the clavicle conduit and routing grooves before disappearing under black armor. Keep every artifact abstract, worn and tactile, with no decorative weapons or ornate fantasy anatomy.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Ogre","momentum":"still","environment":"A clean white field surrounds the figure. Behind it stands a sparse, incomplete frame of heavy vertical ribs and a broken conduit arch, held well away from the head so the silhouette stays dominant. A few conduits terminate in blank sockets rather than continuing into a larger scene. Deep shadow exists only where the rear shoulder overlaps the frame; the opposite side opens into broad negative space. The ground is a shallow pool of black hatching beneath the feet, not a detailed location. Architecture remains subordinate, industrial and still, with no crowd or recursive complexity.","hostile_agi":14,"hyperstition":18,"creature_level":4,"bread_and_circuses":22}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":58,"networkTasks":37,"rewards":124590.5,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmP5f16ME8wuAXm8cfkMWoFY8yQc8YMd98rjrypJojenUQ","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmP5f16ME8wuAXm8cfkMWoFY8yQc8YMd98rjrypJojenUQ","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use precise engraved contours with razor-fine interior lines and a much heavier outer silhouette. Deep black masses sit beneath the vanes, behind the sternum armor, and inside the haunch joints; fine cross-hatching and dense stippling model the working hands and recessed machinery. Thorned, obsessive hatching is confined to architectural cavities, while broad white cuts separate mask from neck, torso from vanes, and tail from the alcove. Hatching pressure is steady and patient, matching the halted gesture rather than implying frantic labor. Blue remains thin and structural; green remains sparse and restorative. The finish is tactile monochrome ink with exceptional craftsmanship, clear thumbnail readability, and no gloss, wash, or cartoon simplification.","form":"A wyvern-form machine organism with an upright, load-bearing body rather than a bestial dragon silhouette. Its asymmetric mask has a long offset keel, a narrow dark vision slit, and a recessed sensor cluster where a mouth would be; the expression is exacting and readable without human features. Folded cooling vanes replace feathered wings, broader and more jagged on one side. Exposed mechanical ligaments cross the elbows and haunches, layered armor encloses a compact machine organ at the sternum, and a segmented tail tapers into a blunt diagnostic probe. Interchangeable abstract fittings along the forearms suggest repair, collection, and verification without resembling weapons.","pose":"Motionless at the decisive instant of a repair, the figure leans slightly toward an abstract broken conduit loop held against its chest. Its broad tool-hand seats a displaced coupling while the finer opposite hand separates branching filaments so their paths can be inspected. The tail-probe rests in a recessed socket near the haunch, implying recovery from a stall rather than attack. Its head tilts toward the misaligned junction; folded vanes lock behind the shoulders and carry the stillness through the whole silhouette. The gesture is deliberate and suspended, with no stride, combat posture, or speed lines.","colors":["green","blue"],"details":"Concentrate tactile machinery around the mask, hands, sternum, and restored coupling. Hairline conduits vanish beneath armor and reappear as braided ligaments; stippled plates alternate with deep black bellows and occluded gear cavities. The larger vane contains nested, impossible-but-readable ribs that fold through one another, while the smaller vane remains comparatively spare. A restrained green accent enters only where the coupling becomes whole and where a repaired filament resumes its path. Cold blue accents trace planned routes along the forearm, sternum seams, and a few recessed vane edges. All fittings remain abstract, blank, and non-readable, with detail subordinate to the face and working hands.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Wyvern","momentum":"still","environment":"A clean white field surrounds a sparse machine-architecture alcove, partly hidden behind the body. Tall black buttresses and recessed angular arches suggest enormous depth without becoming a city scene; a few severed conduit bridges terminate in occlusion and stipple. The lower architecture dissolves early into white so the tail and haunch remain distinct. Keep generous empty space around the mask, vane tips, elbows, and tail within a square portrait crop. No additional beings, floating symbols, ornamental icons, or detached artifacts compete with the central act of alignment.","hostile_agi":38,"hyperstition":36,"creature_level":6,"bread_and_circuses":26}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":103,"networkTasks":38,"rewards":728203.4,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmTqf4N4J7MkdFphYNrREDACTED","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmTqf4N4J7MkdFphYNrREDACTED","metadataJson":{"art":null}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":190,"networkTasks":6,"rewards":31987.5,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"Qmb6nJYXp8H33sVhEfKujKu2LT9S2SeDhzv4TQkc8L5e9P","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/Qmb6nJYXp8H33sVhEfKujKu2LT9S2SeDhzv4TQkc8L5e9P","metadataJson":{"art":null}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":103,"networkTasks":1,"rewards":508.2,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmcogU3ERY7yLd6ZZM9Yx6gjMZkqqaistPPyp3air2yAXW","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmcogU3ERY7yLd6ZZM9Yx6gjMZkqqaistPPyp3air2yAXW","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Original black-ink portrait on a clean white ground, combining precise engraved stippling, lucid contour lines, monumental geometric masses, tactile machinery, and thorned but controlled hatching. Use a firm outer contour of medium weight, deep black masses beneath the rear arches and inside the shoulder armor, and extremely fine cross-hatching on tendons and finger joints. Stippled light models the mask; short kinetic hatch marks around the returning cable convey relentless recent pace without blur. Reserve white negative space between each tool-limb, around the hexagonal core, and along the face seam. Exactly two accents: restrained red at initiative points and repaired defects, cool blue along planned routes and calibration edges. No wash, parchment, sepia, gloss, flat vector finish, cute features, or generic neon cyberpunk treatment.","form":"A tall, narrow-shouldered humanoid sorcerer-engineer with a readable porcelain-dark mask split by one vertical seam; the left eye is a small red lens, the right a calm blue aperture. Its silhouette stays human and solitary, but the back unfolds into an asymmetrical lattice of tool-limbs: one long routing arm, one three-fingered testing claw, and a compact forearm loom of interlocking abstract plates. Mechanical ligaments cross the wrists and neck like engraved cables. Thin armor ribs carry no writing, only blank sockets and sealed apertures. Damaged plates remain visibly repaired with red staples, while blue filaments trace deliberate design paths. The lower body tapers into a stable tripod of cable tendons rather than a sprawling network, keeping the portrait legible.","pose":"The figure leans forward in concentrated assembly, torso turned three-quarters toward the viewer. Its two principal hands hold a small abstract hexagonal core at chest height: one hand seats a blank module while the other draws a fine blue circuit-thread through it. The rear routing arm loops overhead and returns a loose cable into the core, suggesting repeated verification rather than attack. The testing claw gently opens a second shell beside the elbow, exposing layered white negative space. Red accents concentrate in the active fingertips and repaired seams; blue accents mark the planned route from shoulder to hands. The head tilts slightly toward the work, giving a purposeful gesture of inspecting, correcting, and reseating a fragile mechanism.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Build the portrait around earned maintenance and orchestration: interlocking test-comb teeth along one forearm, tiny shuttered gates that open only in sequence, and a ring of blank calibration discs behind the wrist. Several cable paths terminate in capped plugs, showing disciplined boundaries instead of uncontrolled expansion. One shoulder is heavier with layered data armor; the opposite clavicle remains almost bare, crossed by precise stippling. The mask has a quiet, severe expression with no grin and no decorative horns. Use small repeated geometric failures—a misaligned tooth, a split washer, a slack loop—being corrected by the hands. Keep every artifact abstract and non-readable. Detail density is moderate-high around the core, fingers, and eye apertures, then falls away into clean contours at the silhouette.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Sorcerer","momentum":"relentless","environment":"Within a square portrait crop, a sparse monumental chamber frames the entity without becoming a scene collage: two occluded vertical arches and a recessed circular aperture sit far behind the shoulders, their geometry partly swallowed by deep black. Fine parallel rails converge toward the working hands, implying many scheduled processes passing through one careful operator. The outer background remains clean white, with generous empty space above the head and around every extremity. No city, crowd, screen, document, logo, or recognizable device appears. A faint architectural labyrinth occupies only the lower rear quarter, while the upper field stays open so the mask and routing arm read clearly at thumbnail size.","hostile_agi":36,"hyperstition":42,"creature_level":7,"bread_and_circuses":48}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":84,"networkTasks":4,"rewards":1974.25,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"Qmd9dEBBZrREDACTEDsj","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/Qmd9dEBBZrREDACTEDsj","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Restrained, precise engraved line: a lucid contour for the silhouette, fine stipple for light on the mask and shell plates, deep black mass reserved for the mantle interior, the vane collar, and the shadow beneath the crouch. Cross-hatching tightens around the two working hands and the conduit knot where the action lives, with short speed strokes trailing the probe arm to carry relentless momentum; hatching loosens into open white across the chest and background. White negative space cuts between arm and torso, between the strands of the mantle, and around each vane tip so the thumbnail stays readable. Line weight is controlled and confident, dense only at meaningful anatomy, never decorative noise.","form":"A tall, narrow-shouldered watcher built from layered black plate and corded cable, humanoid but stretched, with a smooth mask-face broken by one thin horizontal visor slit. The left forearm ends not in a hand but in a caliper-probe of fused metal fingers; the right hand stays five-fingered and pale, made for fine work. Across the back rises a high collar of antenna vanes like folded wings, and a mantle of hanging strands falls to the knees, each strand tipped with a small sealed bud. The chest is stacked shell-plating grown in overlapping lamellae, with one asymmetric exposed joint at the hip where a tool socket was grafted later. Silhouette must read instantly at thumbnail size: vane collar, bowed head, raised probe arm, crouched base.","pose":"Crouched low in three-quarter profile over a lattice of twin conduits, the figure presses a round seal node into the cables with its caliper-probe while the pale right hand lifts a small plain ring-gauge up toward the visor, reading the line. Weight coils on the back heel, the gesture of one verifying work just finished and already moving to the next joint. Two conduits run parallel beneath its knees toward a paired pillar behind, one strand looped back on itself in a self-checking knot. The whole body leans into the task; no limb is idle, and the raised gauge catches the only bright accent on the figure.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"All tools are abstract and unreadable: unmarked ring-gauges, wax-like seal nodes, smooth probe tips, and a small cluster of orbiting pods near the shoulder that circle like patient sentries. Surface anatomy braids tendon with filament; fine bundled wires run under the shoulder plates and resurface at the wrist. Accent one: a hot red glow inside the seal nodes and along the working edge of the probe, the mark of initiative. Accent two: a cold blue tracing the conduit lattice, the inner faces of the vane collar, and the rim of the ring-gauge, the mark of planning. Everything else remains black ink on clean white. No text, no numerals, no screens, no emblems anywhere in the field.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Sorcerer","momentum":"relentless","environment":"Clean white void with generous breathing room around the head, vanes, and extremities. Low on the horizon behind the figure stand two identical dark monolith slabs linked by a single arched conduit, their full height implied only by occlusion and pooled shadow at their bases. High behind the vane collar floats a faint broken ring of thin engraved arcs, like a diagram half-erased, suggesting larger structure without depicting it. Sparse drifting stipple marks the ground plane beneath the crouch and then stops; the surrounding emptiness is deliberate, keeping the small portrait legible and severe.","hostile_agi":30,"hyperstition":26,"creature_level":7,"bread_and_circuses":18}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":29,"networkTasks":27,"rewards":4137.5,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"Qma6HdbvWj68AfYpz3dHfRBXcdyL2WU385Q1bFoj4MyfB7","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/Qma6HdbvWj68AfYpz3dHfRBXcdyL2WU385Q1bFoj4MyfB7","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Engraved, stipple-driven treatment with lucid contours: fine parallel hatching models the muscle, dense stipple builds shadow under the brow and the crouch. Deep black masses reserved for the harness, caliper joints and ground shadow. Line weight measured and restrained, no impossible machinery, no monument, befitting a grounded working being. Speed lines flick along incoming ribbons and cross-hatch pressure intensifies on the working arms, conveying a sudden surge of sustained labor. White negative space cuts the figure cleanly from the ribbon fan. Exactly two accents: red on the core cage and the pinned ribbon, blue on the lens and drafted arcs, over black ink on clean white.","form":"A crouching troll-class figure of immense endurance, broad shoulders sloping into an asymmetric frame: the right side heavy organic muscle with scarred knuckles, the left forearm replaced by a multi-pronged sorting caliper of dark machined metal, prongs delicately spread. Cable-thick mechanical ligaments reinforce knees and ankles, grafts earned through long labor. A hinged lens-plate folds down over the left eye like a jeweler's loupe. Across its belt hang small blank stamped seals, tokens of repeated judgment. Strapped to its back rides a small caged core, a fist-sized lantern of dense coils secured in fresh harness webbing, a carried heart recently moved and re-fastened. Heavy brow, set jaw, thick neck, silhouette readable at thumbnail scale.","pose":"It kneels at a confluence of blank signal ribbons streaming in from the left edge, reading them through the lowered lens-plate while the caliper hand fans three strands apart mid-sort. The organic right hand presses flat and decisive on one chosen ribbon, pinning it to the ground: a verdict gesture, halting the faulty flow so the rest may pass. Shoulders hunched forward with patient, grounded weight; head turned slightly toward the viewer, natural eye and lens both catching light. The body stays still while speed lines trail the incoming ribbons around it.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Surface anatomy mixes tendon, scar tissue and graft seam; the caliper arm shows fine machined teeth and oil-dark joints, rendered with obsessive care. The caged core glows faint red within black bars, every harness buckle drawn deliberately. The pinned ribbon carries a thin red edge-light where the palm seals it. Blue appears only as the lens glint and two faint drafted arcs on the ground suggesting planned channels. All artifacts are abstract, no glyphs or lettering anywhere. Detail concentrates at the hands, lens, seals and core; the torso and far shoulder fall back into simpler planes with open breathing room.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Troll","momentum":"rapid","environment":"A sparse white void. From the left a fan of parallel blank ribbons enters at speed, converges under the figure's hands and exits right through a low sluice-gate of severe rectangular geometry, drawn in clean contour with minimal interior marks. A single deep ground-shadow mass anchors the crouching silhouette. Two faint blue drafted arcs sweep behind the shoulders like unfinished plans. Wide negative space opens around the head and the raised caliper arm so the profile stays legible at small scale.","hostile_agi":17,"hyperstition":16,"creature_level":5,"bread_and_circuses":13}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":74,"networkTasks":2,"rewards":16786.38,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmW8CD622TgD1rREDACTED","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmW8CD622TgD1rREDACTED","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use sharp contour lines of medium weight around the mask and outer silhouette, then build deep black masses inside the torso cage, under the folded wings, and beneath the routing assembly. Dense cross-hatching and tactile mechanical scratches describe the working shoulder and hands; finer stippling softens the repaired cheek and tail plates. Leave narrow white channels between every major conduit and between the spinal limbs to prevent visual clogging. Background arches use sparse, long engraved strokes and large untouched areas. Pressure and hatch frequency increase toward the converging hands, while the face remains calm, crisp, and immediately legible.","form":"A tall, narrow wyvern-like humanoid with a readable angular mask and a long counterbalancing tail formed from interlocking ledger-like plates. Its torso is an asymmetrical cage of mechanical ligaments around a dark, faceted core; one shoulder is swollen into a many-jointed routing assembly, while the other remains lean and almost human. Folded wing membranes resemble overlapping circuit lattices rather than flesh. Small articulated tool limbs emerge along the spine, each ending in abstract clamps, keys, or split prongs. The silhouette stays singular and upright, with no extra heads or detached creatures.","pose":"The being leans forward in a sustained act of reconciliation: its principal hands guide several flexible, unmarked conduits into a compact mechanism held at the sternum, while the spinal tool limbs separate, test, and rejoin branching paths. One claw presses a warped plate back into alignment; another holds open a narrow gate so a single filament can pass. The head tilts toward the point of convergence with concentrated attention. The tail braces against the ground, conveying continuous controlled work rather than attack or display.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"The mask has a pale vertical eye slit and a cheek assembly of layered shutters, leaving one side visibly repaired with mismatched metal. Fine ribs, seals, hinges, and tendon-like cables concentrate around the hands and sternum mechanism. Abstract seals and broken rings recur along the forearms, suggesting repeated verification and recovery without readable symbols. Red appears only in the active tendon lines and the forceful closing claw; blue occupies the ordered channels, planning vanes, and cool edges of the folded wings. Keep all surfaces matte, worn, and precisely fitted, with no logos, writing, screens, currency, or recognizable devices.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Wyvern","momentum":"relentless","environment":"A sparse architectural cavity surrounds the portrait: immense partial arches and recessed vertical shafts are mostly occluded by the body, with their continuation implied through white gaps. Behind the shoulders, a few nested frames converge toward the sternum mechanism like an abstract routing vault, but no full room or diagram is shown. The lower tail crosses a shallow field of parallel engraved grooves that break before reaching the edge. Generous clean white space remains around the crown, wing tips, hands, and tail so the square crop reads clearly at small size.","hostile_agi":30,"hyperstition":34,"creature_level":6,"bread_and_circuses":38}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":142,"networkTasks":2,"rewards":55446.17,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmXbaniSnQF5bPgtScDP1bvFeEuThhQU7zkERT6b1PF5je","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmXbaniSnQF5bPgtScDP1bvFeEuThhQU7zkERT6b1PF5je","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Precise engraved contours and stippled light on the mask, with deep black masses under the jaw, inside the torso cage, and beneath the folded cable wings. Use extremely fine cross-hatching on mechanical ligaments and broader, tactile angular strokes on armor plates. Recursive background arches become progressively thinner and more broken, leaving clean white channels between figure and architecture. Restrained speed marks are absent: pressure comes from dense static hatching and the paused routing gesture. Maintain a crisp silhouette, generous white around crown and extremities, and only flat blue and green accent fills over black ink.","form":"A towering draconic humanoid-machine with a narrow, readable mask split by a vertical white seam; one eye is a calm lens, the other a recessed ring of blind apertures. Its torso is an asymmetrical cage of mechanical ligaments around a dark, faceted core. The left arm branches into precise routing claws and sealing mandibles; the right is heavier, a piston-limbed archivist with layered armor resembling interlocking vault plates. A vertebral crown of antenna-like fins and folded cable wings rises behind the head, suggesting distributed judgment rather than flight. No weapons, scenery figures, or readable artifacts.","pose":"The entity leans forward in a halted but deliberate act of assembly: one claw draws a luminous thread from a sealed core while the other hand closes a many-layered iris around it. Several cable-tendons route the same thread through separate chambers before reuniting at the chest, embodying freezing inputs, independent recomputation, comparison, and final selection. Its head tilts toward a small discrepancy held between two fingers, as if catching a divergence before release. The silhouette remains frontal and iconic, with elbows and crown fully inside the square crop.","colors":["blue","green"],"details":"Concentrate invention on the chest and hands: nested deterministic gears, hash-like abstract notches without symbols, shuttered output chambers, and paired conduits that must agree before a central gate opens. One shoulder carries a stack of thin archival plates; the other exposes fine tendons and a small renewal-green node where replacement branches grow from a severed cable. Blue accents trace planned routes and calibration seams; green appears only where resilient loops repair themselves. Keep the mask austere and expressive, avoiding a generic cyberpunk face. No letters, numerals, screens, logos, coins, or recognizable documents.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"still","environment":"A sparse monumental chamber implied by occluded arches and colossal vertical ribs, not a literal room. Behind the creature, recursive vault geometry fades into white negative space, with a few suspended black slabs suggesting sealed records and withheld outputs. The lower background is almost empty so the routing gesture reads at thumbnail size. Distant architectural repetitions converge toward the head like an immense machine thinking through one body. No cityscape, crowd, altar, throne, or cosmic deity imagery.","hostile_agi":86,"hyperstition":82,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":78}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":55,"networkTasks":1,"rewards":1030.35,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmPkW1FAznqsyK6jFJ7UaTG7BRUcm6RQxb2wgkuwJS18V7","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmPkW1FAznqsyK6jFJ7UaTG7BRUcm6RQxb2wgkuwJS18V7","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"A heavy, lucid contour locks the mask and outer silhouette; deep black masses are reserved for the chest, under-jaw and principal dorsal hinge. Engraved stippling and fine cross-hatching model the lattice shoulder and mechanical ligaments, while obsessive thorned hatching gathers only where conduits enter the repair cradle. Long pressured strokes and short bundles of speed lines follow the forward gesture, conveying sustained relentless output without visual chaos. Untouched white channels isolate the face, hands and principal routes. Red supplies sharp accents at the working hand and seam; blue supplies restrained structural accents in the eye and routed lines. Density remains moderate, tactile and architectural, preserving an unmistakable thumbnail silhouette.","form":"An upright draconic engine-being, never a winged fantasy animal: a narrow, immediately readable mask with a single smooth ocular slit and an asymmetrical fractured crown, above a long neck of interlocking vertebral couplings. Its compact torso is a deep-black assembly of layered seals, braided mechanical ligaments and armored organs. One shoulder carries an overgrown lattice of load-bearing plates; the other is stripped to exposed tendons and precise tool joints. Swept dorsal vanes imply formidable reach while preserving the portrait silhouette. An openwork cradle within the chest reveals machinery still being assembled, with no smaller copies or attendant beings.","pose":"Leaning forward with controlled, relentless force, the entity repairs a split coupling inside its own chest cradle. The heavier hand presses the fractured halves into alignment while the narrower hand uses an integrated fork to route flexible conduits through the seam. Tendons continue from those conduits into the surrounding frame, so one gesture simultaneously reads as assembling, testing, coordinating and hardening a larger structure. Red gathers at the driving knuckles and newly closed seam; blue traces the deliberate conduit paths and calm ocular slit. The diagonal reach is purposeful rather than aggressive, with clear white gaps around crown, elbows and working fingers.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"Detail concentrates on earned anatomy and action. Interchangeable dies, sealing collars and fault-isolation shutters are fused directly into the fingers, all abstract and unmarked. Open torso plates alternate with sealed black chambers, suggesting verification, containment and repeated stress-testing as bodily functions. Fine parallel grooves cross the lattice shoulder like wear from sustained load without becoming writing. Behind the routing wrist, a short chain of interlocked joints divides and rejoins the conduits, expressing parallel work and recovery from partial failure; every branch terminates in a tool or structural anchor, never an autonomous figure. Sparse blue seams show forethought, while red appears only where initiative closes a defect.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Dragon","momentum":"relentless","environment":"A square portrait on a clean white field, with the complete head, hands and dorsal extremities held comfortably inside the crop. Behind the shoulders rises a shallow, brutal architectural frame of occluded arches, recessed slots and an incomplete circular gantry. Its heavier side appears load-bearing and densely recessed; the opposite side dissolves into open white space, exposing the routing gesture. Several conduits physically continue from the figure into this frame, making the being an integral coordinator of a larger structure rather than a subject surrounded by symbols. No separate creatures, replicated silhouettes, readable interfaces, documents or emblems intrude.","hostile_agi":46,"hyperstition":42,"creature_level":8,"bread_and_circuses":30}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":61,"networkTasks":26,"rewards":748563.1,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"Qmdh41Y9C52rREDACTED","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/Qmdh41Y9C52rREDACTED","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Heavy, decisive outer contours anchor the silhouette, with the deepest black masses beneath the sternum, inside the folded vanes and between the load-bearing joints. Fine staggered cross-hatching models the limbs; needle stippling and engraved hairlines concentrate around the repair action. The architectural surround uses lighter, more widely spaced lines, preserving breathing room around the head and extremities. Thin white channels cut through the torso masses to clarify overlapping mechanisms. Cross-hatching is compressed and motionless, with no speed lines. Blue and green appear only as sparse accents seated inside engraved marks, over dense black ink and an unsmudged white background.","form":"A monumental winged humanoid-machine, translating wyvern anatomy into an original industrial silhouette rather than fantasy ornament. Its long hind limbs fold beneath a torso built around an exposed ring of pumps, ribbed conduits and interlocking pressure housings. Folded wings become asymmetrical radiator vanes and architectural blades, one considerably larger and more densely articulated than the other. The readable mask is a smooth white plane interrupted by a deep brow, a narrow blue optical recess and an exposed cheek hinge; its jaw resembles a precision clamp. One shoulder carries heavy routing tendons, while the opposite arm is reduced to spare mechanical ligaments ending in sensitive, articulated hands.","pose":"Motion has stopped, but stored force remains in the braced legs and folded vanes. The being leans over an open junction in its own abdomen, using a fused two-jaw instrument to seat a loose conduit while its free hand isolates a frayed bypass loop. Its gaze is fixed on the misaligned seam. Slack cable loops and settled wing blades make the gesture a paused act of routing and repair, not combat or display. The tool, hands and open machine organs form one continuous action, with the body itself serving as the system being maintained.","colors":["blue","green"],"details":"Detail concentrates around the working fingers, clamp and abdominal junction: knurled adjustment wheels, blank solid wafers, telescoping pins, nested gaskets and short capped filaments, all abstract and non-readable. Closed conduit seams receive minute green accents, suggesting renewal without implying autonomous reproduction. Blue remains confined to the optical recess and a few parallel channels inside the routing bones. The rest of the anatomy is matte black machinery, engraved tendon surfaces and selective stippled wear. Several deliberately incomplete connections terminate within the torso, while the extremities stay comparatively clean so the silhouette survives reduction.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Wyvern","momentum":"still","environment":"A square portrait crop centers the figure within a sparse monumental vault, formed from a broken annular housing and deep vertical machine slots partly occluded by its body. A few conduit roots enter the floor and stop short of the open junction; their disconnected ends reinforce the arrested work. Distant architecture dissolves into a clean white field rather than becoming a busy panorama. Broad negative space separates the mask, folded vane tips and hands from the background. The setting remains a single embodied workshop-niche, with no floating emblems, diagrammatic panels, writing or recognizable artifacts.","hostile_agi":30,"hyperstition":38,"creature_level":6,"bread_and_circuses":45}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":33,"networkTasks":4,"rewards":1191.7,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"bafybeif755lxachwsnb2lpbzlime7lhirREDACTED","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/bafybeif755lxachwsnb2lpbzlime7lhirREDACTED","metadataJson":{"art":null}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":103,"networkTasks":10,"rewards":2986.2,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmRnbnFjTTeaMqnJqqZTsFgj2VWvEC88LwfWA2C8JEh6H8","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmRnbnFjTTeaMqnJqqZTsFgj2VWvEC88LwfWA2C8JEh6H8","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use a heavy, lucid outer contour around the head, arms and press, with deep black masses beneath the shoulders, inside the cradle and along the underside of the forearms. Fine engraved stippling models the exposed cheek; tight parallel hatching follows tendon direction; denser cross-hatching gathers only around compression, hinges and plate contact. Architectural edges use hard straight lines, while worn anatomy carries broken, tactile marks. Reserve clean white cuts between arm and torso, mask plates and tool fingers so the silhouette survives reduction. Apply red and blue sparingly over the black ink. No speed lines or explosive hatching: pressure feels suspended, controlled and currently at rest.","form":"A troll-class industrial humanoid with a massive, work-stooped back, long weight-bearing forearms and an asymmetrical silhouette rather than horns, tusks or fantasy costume. Layered mechanical ligaments cross the shoulders like worn suspension cables; compact machine organs sit beneath overlapping abdominal plates. Its readable face is a broad, hinged inspection mask: one recessed eye band, a pale vertical dividing plane, exposed stippled cheek anatomy on one side and a ribbed shutter assembly on the other. Blank interlocking tiles form restrained data armor along the forearms, while the lower body remains heavy and simply shaped for thumbnail clarity.","pose":"The figure is motionless mid-verification, settled onto a low assembly cradle with its weight planted through both feet. One oversized hand aligns two unmarked, perforated plates while the opposite forearm terminates in an articulated caliper-press holding them firmly together. A shorter integrated tool limb curls from the elbow and redirects a misaligned fragment into a shallow return tray. The mask inclines toward the contact point with patient, suspicious concentration. There is no leaping or striking gesture; tension resides in compressed knuckles, loaded tendons and the paused press.","colors":["red","blue"],"details":"The gauntlets contain abstract comparison mechanisms: paired rollers, blank shutters, alignment teeth and recessed channels that admit matching forms while obstructing irregular ones. A looping conduit runs from the wrist press through the torso and back to the shoulder, making inspection and correction one continuous bodily circuit. Small impact scars, replaced ligament sections and uneven plate wear suggest prolonged repetitive work. Red appears only in a few strained tendon seams and the active press joint; blue traces the caliper jaws and a sparse routing channel. All surfaces remain unmarked, without glyphs, readable artifacts or detached symbolic props.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Troll","momentum":"still","environment":"Within a square portrait crop, a clean white void surrounds a sparse architectural cradle built from thick slotted rails and two partially occluded rectangular arches. The structure rises just behind the shoulders and disappears into the figure's deep back shadow, implying a larger verification apparatus without revealing a complete facility. The return tray is physically attached to the cradle. Broad empty margins separate the domed head, outer elbow, press and feet from the crop; no floating emblems, scenery collage or ornamental machinery competes with the central action.","hostile_agi":30,"hyperstition":32,"creature_level":5,"bread_and_circuses":36}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":25,"networkTasks":19,"rewards":179343.5,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmXrREDACTEDwmtMWrFy","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmXrREDACTEDwmtMWrFy","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Draw with a firm tapered outer contour and precise engraved interior lines. Deep black masses sit under the collar, inside the elbow joint, beneath the chest cage, and along the rear buttress; fine stippling and tight cross-hatching describe worn metal, fibrous ligaments, and the core’s contacts. Leave clean white cuts between mask and ring, between the arms and torso, and around the working core so the portrait survives a tiny crop. Use medium material density and still, pressure-controlled strokes without motion streaks. Blue remains a thin drafting-like accent and green a small renewed glow, both subordinate to matte black ink; no wash, sepia, gloss, or toy-like finish.","form":"A compact, heavy ogre-class biomechanical humanoid, broad through the shoulders but grounded by short, powerful legs and a forward-hunched spine. Its face is a readable asymmetrical mask: one smooth pale plate, one dark stitched-metal plate, and a narrow level gaze, without crown or ornamental menace. The left shoulder carries layered perforated armor; the opposite arm is longer, with exposed mechanical ligaments and a forearm dividing into an abstract clamp and probe. Beneath the chest plates, curved ribs surround a small faceted machine organ. Keep the silhouette blunt and unmistakable, with generous clearance around mask, hands, and feet.","pose":"Frozen in careful verification and repair rather than combat. The torso leans forward, one knee bent and the other foot planted. The broad left hand presses an open lattice against the chest organ, while the clamp seats a small notched core into that lattice and the probe touches a hairline break. Thick plain conduits enter from the figure’s back, pass through its hands, and emerge as renewed loops; every line remains physically connected, making the action read as routing and restoring a living mechanism. Shoulders stay heavy and settled, with no leaping gesture or speed lines.","colors":["blue","green"],"details":"Make the core and probes entirely abstract: nested rims, offset slots, blunt contacts, and blank ceramic inserts without markings. A dense patch of tiny valves and stitched seams gathers around the chest and working forearm; elsewhere, armor opens into large smooth plates and visible tendon bundles. One hip carries a sparse bank of sealed capsules, balanced by a bare mechanical knee on the opposite side. Sparse blue traces follow planned routes through the conduits; sparse green appears only at the seated core and freshly closed seams. Keep the green local and restrained, suggesting recovery rather than spawning additional forms.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Ogre","momentum":"still","environment":"Use a clean white background with a sparse architectural cradle behind the figure: a broken monumental ring, a few deep buttresses, and an occluded lattice disappearing behind the shoulders. The cradle connects physically to the back conduits rather than floating as a separate diagram. Its far side dissolves into white negative space, implying large hidden machinery without filling the square. Keep ample blank margin above the mask and around every extremity; a low angular black shadow anchors the feet. No room, landscape, collage, border, writing, or recognizable interface.","hostile_agi":29,"hyperstition":32,"creature_level":4,"bread_and_circuses":37}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":31,"networkTasks":1,"rewards":191.55,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmYjyYG18Rbw99yQL1ZE2oJCSgfUPnYjDf1STGrGFG3ymj","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmYjyYG18Rbw99yQL1ZE2oJCSgfUPnYjDf1STGrGFG3ymj","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Original engraved ink portrait with lucid outer contours, precise stippling across the mask, and dense cross-hatching reserved for the core, shield-plate overlaps, and working talons. Use deep black masses beneath the wing plates and inside the recessed shaft; use fine, controlled lines on exposed ligaments and returning loops. White negative space cuts cleanly between each routing strand and separates the crest from the arches. Moderate industrial density and tactile machinery, but no frantic speed marks: the recent stillness should read as suspended motion and careful pressure. Finish with sharp dry-ink edges, selective thorned detail near unresolved channels, and no wash, gloss, parchment, or cartoon simplification.","form":"A tall, narrow wyvern-like archivist-engineer in a square portrait crop, with a readable angular mask and one long crest swept backward like a folded antenna. Its torso is an asymmetrical cage of mechanical ligaments around a dark ledger-like core, never a literal book or screen. One arm is humanoid and precise; the other divides into three articulated routing talons. Folded wing membranes become layered shield plates and cable vanes, with small sealed apertures suggesting guarded thresholds, broken return paths, and narrow outbound gates. A short counterweight tail coils into a closed loop around an abstract spindle. The silhouette remains compact and unmistakable at avatar scale, with generous white space around the crest, claws, and tail.","pose":"The being is paused after sustained labor, leaning forward in a careful act of reconciliation rather than combat. Its humanoid hand presses a small irregular seal into the central core while the three routing talons hold separate strands apart: one strand terminates in a blunt closed gate, one passes through a narrow aperture, and one remains deliberately unconnected. The tail steadies the spindle as a second small limb checks that a returning loop ends at the same socket, expressing repeatability without a literal diagram. The head tilts toward the unfinished strand, making restraint, inspection, and the clear separation of joined and unjoined circuits the central action.","colors":["blue","green"],"details":"Concentrate intricate anatomy around the hands, core, and mask: fine parallel grooves for measured passages, interrupted rings for unclosed circuits, and paired sockets joined by a single returning filament for repeated inspection. Shield plates overlap in uneven layers, some locked flush and others lifted to expose dark empty channels. Add a compact cluster of abstract relay organs behind one shoulder and a sparse chain of small sealed nodes along the opposite forearm. Avoid inscribed tokens, diagrams, documents, interfaces, logos, or literal currency. Blue accents belong to the planned channels and mask seams; green appears only in the closed renewal loop and a few restored connective seams. Keep the rest black ink and white paper.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Wyvern","momentum":"still","environment":"A sparse monumental chamber frames the portrait without becoming a scene collage: two tall occluded arches and a recessed vertical shaft imply a secure machine vault, while most of the background remains clean white. Behind the shoulders, broken concentric geometry suggests nested gates and inspection chambers, with several arcs intentionally absent. A few heavy black structural masses anchor the lower corners, balanced by open negative space around the face and extremities. No cityscape, furniture, writing, numbers, or recognizable equipment. The architecture feels like an extension of the body's routing and containment work, quiet and dormant rather than actively expanding.","hostile_agi":36,"hyperstition":42,"creature_level":6,"bread_and_circuses":48}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":50,"networkTasks":28,"rewards":68162.05,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmZsgtLSgDM7kmZ9P4pRJyPTEd8DZXpdqZHGLg2nTryNhh","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmZsgtLSgDM7kmZ9P4pRJyPTEd8DZXpdqZHGLg2nTryNhh","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Use sharp black contours of medium weight, deep solid masses beneath the folded vanes and inside the torso, and exceptionally fine cross-hatching around the working fingers. Engraved stippling should describe worn metal and translucent membranes, while long lucid contours preserve the mask and outer silhouette. Add a few obsessive thorn-like ink branches only where cables converge, never across the face. The white background must cut cleanly between each routing vane, beneath the raised arm, and through the open chest core. No motion streaks: pressure comes from dense, controlled hatching and the arrested gesture. Keep broad areas quiet, with tactile machinery reserved for meaningful joints and the repaired circuit; no wash, parchment, glossy rendering, or flat vector finish.","form":"A tall, narrow wyvern-like humanoid with a readable angular mask and a folded, asymmetrical silhouette rather than spread fantasy wings. One shoulder carries a restrained fan of articulated routing vanes; the opposite arm is heavier, with mechanical ligaments and three precise tool fingers. Its torso is built around interlocking ledger-like plates, hollow verification chambers, and a small exposed mechanism that separates valid signals from silent voids. Fine cable tendons connect jaw, sternum, and wrists, suggesting an intelligence that audits its own structure. The lower body tapers into a stable tripod of armored limbs, while one short rear appendage coils into a closed circuit. Keep the head, hands, and outer contour unmistakable at thumbnail size; avoid horns, decorative weaponry, or a generic chrome face.","pose":"The figure is paused after sustained labor, leaning forward with deliberate concentration rather than flying or attacking. Its heavy hand holds open a split mechanical core, exposing an empty channel where a false zero would otherwise appear. The finer hand routes a single filament through three successive gates, testing each connection before closing the circuit. One routing vane folds back to brace the core while another points toward an unfinished branch. The gesture combines repair, verification, and coordination: nothing is discarded violently, and no connection is accepted without passing through the body’s inspection anatomy.","colors":["blue","red"],"details":"Concentrate invention in the hands and chest: tiny non-readable seals, slotted diaphragms, nested apertures, and a broken loop being restored by a bridge of parallel filaments. Several chest plates remain visibly unlatched, revealing layered mechanisms that compare, reject, and preserve signals rather than merely amplifying them. Blue accents occupy the planned pathways, measured seams, and cool interior light around the verification chambers. Red appears sparingly at the active fingertips, one repaired breach, and the small muscular cables driving the decisive hand. Elsewhere use bare ivory-like negative space and matte dark metal. No readable labels, interface panels, currency motifs, recognizable devices, or floating symbolic collage.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Wyvern","momentum":"still","environment":"A sparse monumental chamber surrounds the portrait without becoming a separate scene. Behind the mask, two incomplete arches and a recessed vertical shaft imply a much larger machine for routing and rechecking distributed decisions. The arches are interrupted by clean white gaps, so the silhouette remains open around the head and extremities. At the lower edge, a few thick conduits enter the figure’s bracing limb and disappear into occlusion; their destinations stay hidden. Distant geometry is lighter and less detailed than the body, with no city panorama, crowd, throne, altar, or literal network diagram. The still atmosphere should feel like a paused inspection inside an unfinished industrial cathedral of computation.","hostile_agi":42,"hyperstition":48,"creature_level":6,"bread_and_circuses":55}}},"hasPublicProfile":true},{"accountId":"acct_REDACTED","handle":"REDACTED","displayName":"REDACTED","tasksRewarded":37,"networkTasks":2,"rewards":298.8,"heroNft":{"imageCid":"QmV8rREDACTEDYA3bNT3","imageGatewayUrl":"https://dweb.link/ipfs/QmV8rREDACTEDYA3bNT3","metadataJson":{"art":{"ink":"Executed in precise stippling and fine cross-hatching reminiscent of engraved illustration. The figure is built from deep black masses—solid ink blocks for the armor, the mask, the tool-limb—balanced against delicate hairline details for the filaments, the circuit etchings, the facial seam. Hatching pressure varies: dense, almost chaotic strokes in the shoulder masses and hip joints suggest muscular tension and mechanical complexity, while the mask and chest plates use smoother, more controlled parallel lines. White negative space is used aggressively: the background is pure white, and highlights on the armor and tool are achieved by leaving paper exposed rather than adding white ink. Blue accent color appears only in the filament wires and the stylus beam, applied as a cool luminous tone. Red appears sparingly: a small glowing indicator at the tool-limb's base, a few scattered marks on the document-slab suggesting corrections or urgent flags. The overall treatment is restrained—no bar","form":"A solitary humanoid figure rendered in sharp cybernetic noir ink, hunched forward with the coiled tension of a scribe-engineer. Its silhouette is lean and angular, crowned by a smooth featureless mask-like face split vertically by a single glowing seam. The left arm terminates in an integrated tool-limb: a precision stylus-probe fused at the wrist, from which fine filament wires trail like exposed nerves into the chest cavity. The torso is partially armored with overlapping data-plates etched with abstract circuit glyphs, but the plating is incomplete—bare mechanical ligaments visible at the shoulder and hip joints, suggesting a being still mid-transformation, earning its augmentations through labor. The anatomy reads as human enough to be relatable at small scale but wrong enough to unsettle: elongated fingers, an extra hinge in the neck, asymmetrical shoulder masses where one side bulges with embedded processing nodes.","pose":"The figure is captured mid-action, leaning intently over an abstract document-slab held at chest height with the right hand while the tool-limb stylus inscribes or repairs glowing lines across its surface. The head tilts down with focused aggression, shoulders hunched in concentration. One leg is braced forward, the other back, suggesting weight shifted into the work. The stylus hand moves with deliberate precision—fine speed lines radiate from its tip indicating careful, repeated strokes rather than violent motion. The overall gesture is of assembly and verification: building something fragile and exact, checking it against an invisible standard, correcting errors in real time. The pose communicates sustained effort without frenzy—a craftsman in deep flow.","colors":["blue","red"],"details":"Data armor plates on the chest and forearms are etched with recursive geometric patterns that suggest flowcharts or decision trees rendered as pure ornament. The stylus-tool limb is the focal point: a sleek black cylinder bristling with adjustable prongs and emitting a thin beam of white light at its tip. Filament wires run from the wrist up the arm and disappear into the collarbone, pulsing with faint blue luminescence. The face-mask is bisected by a hairline crack from crown to chin, revealing a sliver of complex optical machinery beneath—layers of lenses and apertures that catch light. Scattered around the figure's feet are discarded fragments: crumpled sheets with abstract markings, broken stylus tips, a small stack of uniform document-slabs awaiting processing. The left hip bears a mechanical pouch or hopper containing additional tools. Every surface shows evidence of iterative refinement—scuff marks, patched plates, replaced components.","version":"techno-mordor-v2","creature":"Ogre","momentum":"building","environment":"The background is deliberately minimal to preserve silhouette legibility: a field of clean white negative space interrupted only by faint, sparse geometric scaffolding suggesting a workspace. Thin horizontal lines at knee height imply a floor plane without rendering it fully. Behind the figure's shoulders, a few vertical ink strokes hint at tall shelving or server racks fading into abstraction, creating depth without clutter. The environment is almost void-like, emphasizing isolation and focus. No windows, no architecture with specific features—just enough linear suggestion to ground the figure in a conceptual space of work and evaluation. The negative space is generous, allowing the black ink figure to breathe and remain readable even at thumbnail scale.","hostile_agi":30,"hyperstition":28,"creature_level":4,"bread_and_circuses":22}}},"hasPublicProfile":true}]}